---

## Error Handling

- If test runner is not installed: `npm install --save-dev jest @testing-library/react @testing-library/user-event @testing-library/jest-dom` and retry
- If a test file can't be created (e.g. no source file to test): log as skipped in testcases.md with reason
- If coverage report is unavailable: omit the coverage table from testcases.md, note "Coverage data unavailable"
- If tests time out: note as failed, suggest the developer check for missing `act()` wrappers or async cleanup issues
